        168.11550903320312,
        495.13555908203125,
        180.58900451660156
      ],
      "text": "15. Adults and adolescents living with HIV who are unlikely to have active TB should receive TB preventive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        179.51553344726562,
        518.908447265625,
        191.98902893066406
      ],
      "text": "treatment as part of a comprehensive package of HIV care. Treatment should be given to those on antiretroviral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        190.91549682617188,
        521.1466674804688,
        203.3889923095703
      ],
      "text": "treatment, to pregnant women and to those who have previously been treated for TB, irrespective of the degree",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        202.31552124023438,
        499.11566162109375,
        214.7890167236328
      ],
      "text": "of immunosuppression and even if LTBI testing is unavailable  (strong recommendation, high certainty in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        213.71554565429688,
        166.66819763183594,
        226.1890411376953
      ],
      "text": "​  estimates of effect). (22)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        229.87164306640625,
        433.3885192871094,
        243.06163024902344
      ],
      "text": "Algorithms to rule out TB disease prior to offering TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        247.18759155273438,
        488.4286804199219,
        259.6611022949219
      ],
      "text": "16. Adults and adolescents living with HIV who are screened for TB according to a clinical algorithm and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        258.5877380371094,
        507.0286560058594,
        271.0612487792969
      ],
      "text": "who report any of the symptoms of current cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats may have active TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        269.9876403808594,
        515.772216796875,
        282.4611511230469
      ],
      "text": "should be evaluated for TB and other diseases and offered preventive treatment if active TB is excluded  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        281.4161071777344,
        339.11083984375,
        293.6900939941406
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, moderate certainty in the estimates of effect).​ (22)",
