      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        296.2409362792969,
        509.9603271484375,
        308.7144470214844
      ],
      "text": "17. Chest radiography may be offered to people living with HIV on ART and preventive treatment be given to",
