        189.576416015625,
        348.38702392578125
      ],
      "text": "Testing for TB infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        352.51300048828125,
        521.3849487304688,
        364.98651123046875
      ],
      "text": "18. Either the tuberculin skin test or interferon-gamma release assays can be used to test for TB infection  (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        363.91302490234375,
        297.1714172363281,
        376.38653564453125
      ],
      "text": ".​  recommendation, very low certainty of the evidence) (15)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        378.7663269042969,
        520.7711791992188,
        391.2398376464844
      ],
      "text": "19.   antigen-based skin tests (TBSTs) may be used to test for TB infection  Mycobacterium tuberculosis (conditional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        390.19482421875,
        359.4176940917969,
        402.46881103515625
      ],
      "text": "recommendation for the intervention, very low certainty of evidence). (15)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        406.3224182128906,
        240.3184051513672,
        419.5124206542969
      ],
      "text": "TB preventive treatment regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        423.638427734375,
        513.1049194335938,
        436.1119384765625
      ],
      "text": "20. The following options are recommended for the treatment of LTBI regardless of HIV status: 6 or 22 months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        435.0384216308594,
        500.4955749511719,
        447.5119323730469
      ],
      "text": "of daily isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen of weekly rifapentine plus isoniazid, or a 3-month regimen of daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        446.43841552734375,
        490.28607177734375,
        458.91192626953125
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid plus rifampicin ( ). A  strong recommendation, moderate to high certainty in the estimates of effect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        457.8384094238281,
        519.3939208984375,
        470.3119201660156
      ],
      "text": "1-month regimen of daily rifapentine plus isoniazid or 4 months of daily rifampicin alone may also be offered as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        469.2384033203125,
        460.6579284667969,
        481.7119140625
      ],
      "text": "alternatives ( ).​ conditional recommendation, low to moderate certainty in the estimates of effect  (22)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        484.0917053222656,
        499.7154846191406,
        496.5652160644531
      ],
      "text": "21. In settings with high TB transmission, adults and adolescents living with HIV who have an unknown or a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        495.4917297363281,
        512.3600463867188,
        507.9652404785156
      ],
      "text": "positive LTBI test and are unlikely to have active TB disease should receive at least 36 months of daily isoniazid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        506.8916931152344,
        509.0986633300781,
        519.3651733398438
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment (IPT). Daily IPT for 36 months should be given whether or not the person is on ART, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        518.2916870117188,
        507.6338806152344,
        530.7651977539062
      ],
      "text": "irrespective of the degree of immunosuppression, history of previous TB treatment and pregnancy in settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        529.6917114257812,
        513.8458251953125,
        542.1652221679688
      ],
      "text": "considered to have a high TB transmission as defined by national authorities ( conditional recommendation, low",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        541.0916748046875,
        227.61570739746094,
        553.565185546875
      ],
      "text": ").  certainty in the estimates of effect (22)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.1643676757812,
        192.52389526367188,
        592.12939453125
      ],
      "text": "2.4.1.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.3981323242188,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV have a higher risk of developing TB disease compared to the general population,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4454345703125,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "even when on ART and with high CD4 cell counts. The combined use of TPT and ART has been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.3870239257812,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "shown to reduce TB incidence and mortality among people living with HIV, including among those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.431396484375,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "with higher CD4 cell counts  . TPT also provides additional protection when given immediately  (45-47)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.41748046875,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "after the successful completion of treatment for TB disease in people living with HIV  . TPT should  (48)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4356689453125,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "be a core component of the package of care for people living with HIV and should be primarily the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        453.8616943359375,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "responsibility of national HIV and AIDS programmes and HIV service providers  .  (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
